    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），極珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套護甲與外表與關節處均裝有齒輪，這些齒輪彼此咬合。它自 <strong>機械境Mechanus</strong> 的秩序魔法中汲取能量。<br />這套護甲具有4發充能。穿戴盔甲期間，每當你進行一次[[/r d20]]擲骰時，你都可以消耗1發充能將你已骰出的骰值改爲10。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d4]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">該護甲是將重金屬環扣縫進內層的特殊皮甲。金屬環可以加強護甲對劍斧揮擊的抵抗力。環甲比鍊甲低一級，而通常只被那些無力支付更好護甲的人所使用。</span></p><p>The outside surface and internal joints of this armor whir with interlocking gears, drawing on the orderly magic of the plane of Mechanus.</p><p>The armor has 4 charges. If you make a [[/r d20]] roll while wearing this armor, you can expend 1 charge to change the number rolled to a 10. The armor regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor is leather armor with heavy rings sewn into it. The rings help reinforce the armor against blows from swords and axes. Ring mail is inferior to chain mail, and it's usually worn only by those who can't afford better armor.</p></div>",
